{"summary":"Revolutionize the revolving sushi bar in this fresh new sim!","description":"Revolutionize the revolving sushi bar in this fresh new sim!\n\nExpand your menu along with your conveyor belt by designing original creations to complement more classic fare.\n\nBut it takes more than fine food to win customers over. Show your creative flair not only in sushi but in your business model by offering amenities ranging from salad bars to sumo rings. Make enough fans and you'll unlock all new ingredients and amenities--and fresh possibilities with them!\n\nAs your reputation grows, you'll also become eligible for competitions around the country. Hone your expertise along with your fish knives and aim for #1 in the national rankings!\n--\nTry searching for \"Kairosoft\" to see all of our games, or visit us at https://kairopark.jp. Be sure to check out both our free-to-play and our paid games!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nTqGzBrPEzk?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/N5I39YluNs6fhAStabSDciaaEPzn2bVHS0EAJhtSHhXZ61hl3hq5DezDVeupSR2VFQesawaIBavdxzT3eSqIog","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CDNRxsLqLOliutzws4TP9soakNKCqVm870t6DeGggbRC1bbmqCWSxeXe6sQX7-q0O1kp-Nnjo4gX7dbmDE2GOhk","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3So2cDi8pH4vdtgo6m4MT73VfN17c6Ur8mFxInZce9mVVoe4vxYTXY6ZyoeqJHtmS5X8eReXiIg4WysWWvhPtg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GgQjhlZU4BD27EumCH2t97cQbFucNLzQ_d9k5yaNAxaYn_0kv7wsD5T3Uxpows-5mgctjKVYKYdBnEzKLdN8uUE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FAJH2wInUsd6-PjmwjkgVtlY4lSoUkJl7euFjjyfPNqf8kIQ01UmDL1Ytqn8y3l5Xxjp_1C75oKWXAZxk_adbQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0S0ZnzpCRwaRsosO0ll2R53GjRulvCKOHhRLEY1b9Rfb5rH09JxmLp8thHnFZ-t29rYGfMTUpwwyTvqBmjfB","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GknoFSk-BIOP59OAggvejIjb-US8DrUV-JkcGLs5S81Q32kXlwW_hAIVJRyuVhx3PZQ3xnJd44yZVW3xtc_q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_ER3